# Carlos Martins

**Computer Vision, Interactive Systems & Applied AI**

PhD Researcher in Intelligent and Adaptable Software Systems (Universidade de Vigo). Personal space for experimental software, applied computer vision, and interactive prototyping.

---

## About

I build experimental software, technical prototypes, and real-time interfaces at the intersection of software engineering, computer vision, and human-computer interaction. Work here ranges from academic research tools to exploratory experiments and multimedia projects.

## Areas of Interest

- Computer vision and real-time facial/motion analysis
- Human-computer interaction (HCI) and interactive interfaces
- Applied machine learning and on-device inference
- Intelligent and adaptable software systems
- Software architecture and reproducible engineering

## Principles

- Human-centered design
- Privacy by design (local-first and derived-data workflows)
- Reproducibility and testability
- Responsible and transparent use of AI

## Tech Stack

`Python` · `Kotlin` · `JavaScript` · `Docker` · `Android (CameraX)` · `MediaPipe` · `OpenCV` · `Flask`

